            },
            "message": "Patch Set 2:\n\n> Patch Set 2:\n> \n> Priyanga, this looks good overall, we just need a way to handle the CPU modules. Instead of repeating cpu0 and cpu1 twice over like this does now, could you change it instead to go by the chip target for CPUs and emit cpu0, cpu1, cpu2, cpu3 .... and so on? That should cover the DCM cases.\n\nHandled CPU modules cases in this commit https://gerrit.openbmc-project.xyz/c/openbmc/phosphor-mrw-tools/+/33962/2"
        },
